<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>1st PUC PCME — Interactive Study Guide</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #f4f7fb;
      --surface: #ffffff;
      --surface-2: #f8fafc;
      --text: #172033;
      --muted: #64748b;
      --border: #e2e8f0;

      --physics: #2563eb;
      --physics-soft: #eff6ff;

      --chemistry: #059669;
      --chemistry-soft: #ecfdf5;

      --math: #7c3aed;
      --math-soft: #f5f3ff;

      --accent: #0f172a;
      --accent-soft: #e2e8f0;

      --warning: #d97706;
      --warning-soft: #fffbeb;

      --danger: #dc2626;
      --danger-soft: #fef2f2;

      --success: #16a34a;
      --success-soft: #f0fdf4;

      --shadow-sm: 0 2px 8px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05);
      --shadow-md: 0 10px 30px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
      --shadow-lg: 0 20px 55px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.13);

      --radius-sm: 10px;
      --radius-md: 16px;
      --radius-lg: 24px;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family:
        Inter,
        ui-sans-serif,
        system-ui,
        -apple-system,
        BlinkMacSystemFont,
        "Segoe UI",
        sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    button,
    input,
    select {
      font: inherit;
    }

    button {
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    /* =========================
       HEADER
    ========================= */

    .hero {
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 15% 10%, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.13), transparent 30%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 85% 20%, rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.13), transparent 28%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff, #f8fafc);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .hero-inner {
      max-width: 1250px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 48px 24px 34px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #475569;
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 7px 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }

    .hero h1 {
      margin: 16px 0 8px;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.7rem);
      line-height: 1.05;
      letter-spacing: -0.045em;
      max-width: 950px;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 780px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      margin: 12px 0 22px;
    }

    .nav-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .nav-btn {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--text);
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 9px 14px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      transition: 0.2s ease;
    }

    .nav-btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }

    /* =========================
       LAYOUT
    ========================= */

    .container {
      max-width: 1250px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 30px 24px 70px;
    }

    section {
      scroll-margin-top: 24px;
    }

    .section-heading {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-end;
      gap: 20px;
      margin: 8px 0 20px;
    }

    .section-heading h2 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    }

    .section-heading p {
      margin: 5px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    /* =========================
       DASHBOARD SUMMARY
    ========================= */

    .stats-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .stat {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: 18px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }

    .stat .number {
      font-size: 2rem;
      line-height: 1;
      font-weight: 850;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    }

    .stat .label {
      margin-top: 7px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.87rem;
      font-weight: 650;
    }

    .focus-panel {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 34px;
    }

    .focus-box {
      padding: 20px;
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }

    .focus-box h3 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .focus-box ul {
      margin: 0;
      padding-left: 19px;
    }

    .focus-box li {
      margin: 6px 0;
      color: #475569;
    }

    .focus-box strong {
      color: var(--text);
    }

    /* =========================
       FILTER BAR
    ========================= */

    .toolbar {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
      align-items: center;
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      position: sticky;
      top: 12px;
      z-index: 20;
    }

    .search-wrap {
      position: relative;
      flex: 1 1 280px;
    }

    .search-wrap input {
      width: 100%;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--surface-2);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 11px 13px 11px 39px;
      outline: none;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .search-wrap input:focus {
      border-color: #94a3b8;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.16);
    }

    .search-icon {
      position: absolute;
      left: 13px;
      top: 8px;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .filter-group {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 7px;
    }

    .filter-btn {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--surface);
      color: #475569;
      padding: 9px 12px;
      border-radius: 9px;
      font-weight: 750;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      transition: 0.2s ease;
    }

    .filter-btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .filter-btn.active {
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #ffffff;
      border-color: var(--accent);
    }

    /* =========================
       DERIVATION CARDS
    ========================= */

    .topic-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .topic-card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .topic-card.hidden {
      display: none;
    }

    .topic-header {
      padding: 20px 22px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .topic-header-left {
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .subject-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 5px 9px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 0.73rem;
      font-weight: 850;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .subject-Physics {
      background: var(--physics-soft);
      color: var(--physics);
    }

    .subject-Chemistry {
      background: var(--chemistry-soft);
      color: var(--chemistry);
    }

    .subject-Mathematics {
      background: var(--math-soft);
      color: var(--math);
    }

    .topic-title {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      line-height: 1.3;
      letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    }

    .priority {
      white-space: nowrap;
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 5px 9px;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .priority.high {
      background: #fff7ed;
      color: #c2410c;
    }

    .priority.medium {
      background: #f8fafc;
      color: #475569;
    }

    .topic-body {
      padding: 20px 22px 23px;
    }

    .start-box {
      background: var(--surface-2);
      border-left: 4px solid #64748b;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 13px 15px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .label {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 850;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.07em;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
    }

    .start-box p {
      margin: 0;
    }

    .step-section h4,
    .support-grid h4 {
      margin: 0 0 9px;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
    }

    .steps {
      counter-reset: step;
      list-style: none;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      display: grid;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .steps li {
      counter-increment: step;
      position: relative;
      padding: 13px 14px 13px 50px;
      background: #fbfdff;
      border: 1px solid #edf2f7;
      border-radius: 11px;
    }

    .steps li::before {
      content: counter(step);
      position: absolute;
      left: 13px;
      top: 12px;
      width: 26px;
      height: 26px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #e2e8f0;
      color: #334155;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 850;
    }

    .steps li strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .equation {
      display: block;
      overflow-x: auto;
      margin: 8px 0;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      background: #f1f5f9;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 8px;
      color: #0f172a;
      font-family:
        "Cambria Math",
        Cambria,
        Georgia,
        "Times New Roman",
        serif;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
      text-align: center;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .equation.compact {
      margin: 5px 0;
      padding: 7px 9px;
      font-size: 0.98rem;
    }

    .support-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 13px;
      margin-top: 18px;
    }

    .trap-box,
    .hack-box,
    .final-box {
      padding: 14px;
      border-radius: 11px;
    }

    .trap-box {
      background: var(--danger-soft);
      border: 1px solid #fecaca;
    }

    .trap-box h4 {
      color: var(--danger);
    }

    .hack-box {
      background: var(--success-soft);
      border: 1px solid #bbf7d0;
    }

    .hack-box h4 {
      color: var(--success);
    }

    .final-box {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      background: #f8fafc;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .final-formula {
      font-size: 1.12rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #0f172a;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .empty-state {
      padding: 40px 20px;
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px dashed #cbd5e1;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    /* =========================
       FLASHCARD SECTION
    ========================= */

    .flash-section {
      margin-top: 60px;
    }

    .flash-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 300px;
      gap: 20px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .flash-card-wrap {
      perspective: 1400px;
      min-height: 480px;
    }

    .flash-card {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 480px;
      transform-style: preserve-3d;
      transition: transform 0.72s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1);
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .flash-card.flipped {
      transform: rotateY(180deg);
    }

    .flash-face {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      backface-visibility: hidden;
      -webkit-backface-visibility: hidden;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
      padding: 38px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .flash-front {
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 10% 15%, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.10), transparent 28%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 90% 85%, rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.10), transparent 28%),
        #ffffff;
    }

    .flash-back {
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 85% 10%, rgba(5, 150, 105, 0.12), transparent 30%),
        linear-gradient(145deg, #ffffff, #f8fafc);
      transform: rotateY(180deg);
    }

    .flash-small {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.77rem;
      font-weight: 850;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }

    .flash-topic {
      font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);
      line-height: 1.07;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      margin: auto 0;
      max-width: 800px;
    }

    .flash-hint {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      margin-top: auto;
    }

    .flash-back h3 {
      margin: 7px 0 14px;
      font-size: 1.35rem;
    }

    .flash-back .hack-preview {
      background: var(--success-soft);
      border: 1px solid #bbf7d0;
      border-radius: 13px;
      padding: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 13px;
    }

    .flash-back .final-preview {
      background: #f1f5f9;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 13px;
      padding: 16px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .flash-controls {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 10px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 16px;
    }

    .control-btn {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: #ffffff;
      color: var(--text);
      padding: 10px 15px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-weight: 800;
      transition: 0.2s ease;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }

    .control-btn:hover:not(:disabled) {
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    }

    .control-btn.primary {
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #ffffff;
      border-color: var(--accent);
    }

    .control-btn:disabled {
      opacity: 0.45;
      cursor: not-allowed;
    }

    .deck-sidebar {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 20px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      position: sticky;
      top: 75px;
    }

    .deck-sidebar h3 {
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .progress-bar {
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: #e2e8f0;
      margin: 10px 0 16px;
    }

    .progress-fill {
      height: 100%;
      width: 0%;
      border-radius: inherit;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #2563eb, #7c3aed);
      transition: width 0.25s ease;
    }

    .deck-number {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      font-weight: 850;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    }

    .deck-topic {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    .deck-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 6px;
      max-height: 280px;
      overflow: auto;
      padding-right: 3px;
      margin-top: 17px;
    }

    .deck-item {
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      background: #f8fafc;
      padding: 8px 10px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      color: #475569;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .deck-item.active {
      background: #eff6ff;
      color: #1d4ed8;
      border-color: #bfdbfe;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    /* =========================
       QUICK RECALL
    ========================= */

    .recall-section {
      margin-top: 60px;
    }

    .recall-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 15px;
    }

    .recall-card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: 19px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }

    .recall-card h3 {
      margin: 0 0 11px;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .recall-card p {
      margin: 8px 0;
    }

    .formula-big {
      font-family:
        "Cambria Math",
        Cambria,
        Georgia,
        "Times New Roman",
        serif;
      font-size: 1.08rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 10px;
      background: #f8fafc;
      border-radius: 9px;
      overflow-x: auto;
    }

    /* =========================
       FOOTER
    ========================= */

    footer {
      max-width: 1250px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 24px 45px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    /* =========================
       RESPONSIVE
    ========================= */

    @media (max-width: 950px) {
      .stats-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }

      .flash-layout {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .deck-sidebar {
        position: static;
      }

      .recall-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .hero-inner,
      .container {
        padding-left: 16px;
        padding-right: 16px;
      }

      .stats-grid,
      .focus-panel,
      .support-grid,
      .recall-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .final-box {
        grid-column: auto;
      }

      .topic-header {
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      .flash-face {
        padding: 25px;
      }

      .flash-card,
      .flash-card-wrap {
        min-height: 420px;
      }

      .toolbar {
        position: static;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <!-- =========================
       HERO
  ========================== -->

  <header class="hero">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <div class="eyebrow">1st PUC • Karnataka State Board • PCME</div>

      <h1>Physics, Chemistry & Mathematics Study Guide</h1>

      <p>
        Step-by-step derivations, common traps, final formulas and memory hacks
        designed for quick exam preparation.
      </p>

      <div class="nav-row">
        <a class="nav-btn" href="#dashboard">📚 Dashboard</a>
        <a class="nav-btn" href="#flashcards">🃏 Flashcards</a>
        <a class="nav-btn" href="#recall">⚡ Quick Recall</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>


  <main class="container">

    <!-- =========================
         DASHBOARD
    ========================== -->

    <section id="dashboard">

      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <h2>Dashboard</h2>
          <p>Read the derivations from start to finish and watch for the highlighted traps.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="stats-grid">
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="number">34</div>
          <div class="label">Study topics</div>
        </div>

        <div class="stat">
          <div class="number">18</div>
          <div class="label">Physics topics</div>
        </div>

        <div class="stat">
          <div class="number">8</div>
          <div class="label">Chemistry topics</div>
        </div>

        <div class="stat">
          <div class="number">8</div>
          <div class="label">Mathematics topics</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="focus-panel">

        <div class="focus-box">
          <h3>🎯 5-Mark Focus</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Projectile trajectory</strong> — prove the path is parabolic.</li>
            <li><strong>Atwood machine</strong> — derive acceleration and tension.</li>
            <li><strong>Work-energy theorem</strong> — derive using calculus/integration.</li>
            <li><strong>Mathematics trigonometric identities</strong> — know the expansion patterns.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="focus-box">
          <h3>🧠 How to Study</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>First read the <strong>Starting Point</strong>.</li>
            <li>Follow every algebraic step without skipping.</li>
            <li>Cover the answer and reproduce the derivation yourself.</li>
            <li>Use the <strong>Flashcards</strong> for final-formula recall.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

      </div>


      <!-- FILTER TOOLBAR -->

      <div class="toolbar">

        <div class="search-wrap">
          <span class="search-icon">⌕</span>
          <input
            id="searchInput"
            type="search"
            placeholder="Search projectile, Bohr, sine, Atwood..."
            autocomplete="off"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="filter-group">
          <button class="filter-btn active" data-filter="All">All</button>
          <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="Physics">Physics</button>
          <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="Chemistry">Chemistry</button>
          <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="Mathematics">Mathematics</button>
        </div>

      </div>


      <!-- TOPICS WILL BE INSERTED HERE -->

      <div id="topicList" class="topic-list"></div>

      <div id="emptyState" class="empty-state" hidden>
        <strong>No matching topic found.</strong>
        <div>Try another search term or choose a different subject.</div>
      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- =========================
         FLASHCARDS
    ========================== -->

    <section id="flashcards" class="flash-section">

      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <h2>3D Flip-Flashcard Deck</h2>
          <p>Click the card to flip it. Front = topic. Back = memory hack + final formula.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flash-layout">

        <div>

          <div class="flash-card-wrap">

            <div id="flashCard" class="flash-card">

              <!-- FRONT -->

              <div class="flash-face flash-front">

